{title: Papa Meri Jaan}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Animal}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] Ambar pe mere [D] ek hee tara,        [C] Woh ek tara [Bm] hoo tum
[Em] Naa koi khuda [D] mera tere siva,        [C] Mera jag saara [Bm] hoo tum
[Em] Maine tumhein [D] jaha rakha,        [C] Koi nahi hain [Bm] wahan
[Em] Papa meri jaan haar [D] dum rakhana,        [C] Aab hath ye saar [Bm] par tum
[Em] Papa meri jaan [D] mere sang chalna,        [C] Haar meel ka [Bm] pathar tum
[Em] Tumhein pe to [D] theharte hain,        Yee [C] rasatein mere [Bm] liye
Naa [Em] isse badi mere [D] koi khushi,        Mujhe [C] dekho jo has [Bm] kar tum
Tum [Em] ko kuch bhi [D] hone na dunga,        Ye [C] likh lo dil [Bm] paar tum
